portrait.png is the card's portrait photograph.

Supplied by the repository owner on 2026-08-12 and reduced from a 1024x1024
original to 256x256 with a box filter. The example crops to the head before it
scales, and lifts local contrast before dithering.

SHA-256  001be0a97a79a623a6e34a0300410be6561ea60b5a8693e50225c2fe7a15ab1d

The original file was named generated_image.png, so it is presumably machine
generated; who holds rights in it has not been established. The repository is
GPL-3.0-or-later, so if this is not the owner's to relicense it should be
replaced. The example reads any square PNG at this path and needs no other
change, though a dark subject needs the contrast pass and a line drawing does
not.
